JetFighter sent a Pm to roflgamer: New in 2.595:
+ Added client side speed hack protection.
+ Added Web URL, a nice little thing for developers and managers to directly upload files to my server. No changes for you, players
* Now the character repeat should be turned on by default. if not, you can press f2 in the chat window to activate it.
* Gives your settings file, which is stored in your App Data directory, an use again. Now you dont have to set your old settings and type in your login credentials every startup again!
+ Changed the key to see cords from X to C, and the key to copy buffer items from C to X. That was annoying.
- Removes the star item from all maps, as its useless currently.
New in 2.593: 
* another CM hosting try
* Bugfixes
New in 2.592: 
* Developer switch
+ Added some sounds
New in 2.591:
Compatibility for future server side items.
New in version 2.59:
Adds language channels, press f5 to access them.
New in version 2.58:
Changes encryption keys.
New in version 2.57:
The builder menu shouldn't make you disconnect anymore.
Your buffers will export when kicked or exitted now.
Voice chat is back! and this time it works!
The updater no longer requires admin rights to run. If you know anyone who can't update, tell them to download from https://jennios.com/games/cm.zip.
You can use the p key to use a potion again!
New in version 2.56:
Removes some menu options that weren't being used.
Adds the hell burner item!
Other misc changes.
New in version 2.55:
Adds running shoes to the team store!
You no longer can fall off the edges of maps.
adds the shield repair item. (Purchasable from the team store.)
New in version 2.54:
Adds back the redownload the game and the restart your client options to the main menu.
Removed typing sounds.
Adds the keys for accessing the builder menu to the builder helper.
New in version 2.53:
Fixes the zone runtime error, thanks brandon for telling me how it happened.
Adds back typing sounds.
New in version 2.52:
Adds a builder menu for builders.
New in version 2.51:
Adds minibombs! Have fun blowing up your enemies!
New in version 2.5:
Adds support for server side menu creation.
Notes play the read sound again.
exp now appears in the stats category of your inventory.
New in version 2.49:
Twitter support has returned, it will tweet when you kill someone if you set it up.
New in version 2.48:
Security enhancements
New in version 2.47:
Now the game will start logging buffers in the logs folder.
Messed up versions, so here's notes! these little things are like text squares but have nice little sounds on them, like signs in sbyw. soon i may even make these inventory items but for now they can be built only on maps.
New in version 2.46:
Now you don't walk like a snail up and down staircases!
Adds shields!
New in version 2.45:
Fixes the connection has been lost bug when trying to update.
New in version 2.44
Bug fix
Coordinates are back.
New in version 2.43
Changes the spyer to right control only, to avoid firing issues.
Autoupdater is back.
Security updates.
Adds builder documentation again.
Brings back client motd's
Adds sound updater!
Adjusts jumptime so no more flying across the map when jumping!
New in version 2.42:
*the Jumping key changed to space, And the fireing key changed to control
*Fixed staircase bug.
*Added scuffing sounds for some tiles.
*Fixed the falling speed.
New in version 2.4.1:
*Now: You can use  shift 1 , 2 , 3 , etc ETC. To access a lot of weapons.
