New in version 2.01B: 
it's a small update , So : sorry about this.
*Added new weapons : UMP45 and uzi.
*Added new buffer: alerts. Not working.
*Added a spyer. Press control  with the direction in which you want to spy in.
*Removed speed! Now you dont need speed to walk & run fast. Enjoy.
